gle card, ensuring no one can beat it unless they have a rocket or bomb. Given the landlord has 10 cards and already used a Black Joker, they likely lack the Red Joker for a rocket. Playing ♣A secures control for my teammate.\n\nReason: Playing the Ace maximizes safety by guaranteeing it cannot be beaten (except by rockets/bombs which the landlord likely lacks). This allows my teammate to play their cards next, improving our coordination against the landlord.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣A"]}'}
